WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:03.102
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show"!

00:00:03.102 --> 00:00:07.440
♪♪

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.076
-Well, it seems like there's
so much going on right now.

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:14.580
Tropical depression Henri
is still hitting the Northeast,

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:16.983
WNBA champs the Seattle Storm

00:00:16.983 --> 00:00:18.952
visited Biden
at the White House,

00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:22.755
the pumpkin spice latte is back,

00:00:22.755 --> 00:00:25.992
and a woman found nuts and bolts
in her Domino's pizza.

00:00:25.992 --> 00:00:27.593
[ Laughter ]
There's a lot to go over,

00:00:27.593 --> 00:00:29.295
so let's just jump in
and cover it all at once.

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:30.796
It's time for a "News Smash."

00:00:30.796 --> 00:00:36.435
[ Cheering and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:36.435 --> 00:00:39.972
First up, the WNBA champions
the Seattle Storm.

00:00:39.972 --> 00:00:41.807
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:41.807 --> 00:00:44.110
They visited President Biden
today, and get this --

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:45.978
they're the first WNBA team

00:00:45.978 --> 00:00:48.981
to be invited to the White House
since 2015.

00:00:48.981 --> 00:00:51.684
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:51.684 --> 00:00:53.118
It's a pretty big deal.

00:00:53.118 --> 00:00:55.721
Speaking of storms
that are a pretty big deal,

00:00:55.721 --> 00:00:57.156
tropical depression Henri.

00:00:57.156 --> 00:00:58.825
[ Laughter ]
Over the weekend,

00:00:58.825 --> 00:01:01.761
45 million people were
under a tropical storm warning,

00:01:01.761 --> 00:01:04.597
so, last week, things on the
East Coast were hot and sticky

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:06.599
and, this week,
things were just wet.

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:07.967
[ Laughter ]
And if you want something

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:10.469
that's just hot, wet,
and sticky, why not try

00:01:10.469 --> 00:01:12.638
Starbucks' pumpkin spice latte?

00:01:12.638 --> 00:01:15.108
[ Laughter and applause ]
It's back.

00:01:15.108 --> 00:01:17.310
Starting tomorrow.

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:18.945
Some people are excited,
while others think

00:01:18.945 --> 00:01:20.947
it's too early
for pumpkin spice.

00:01:20.947 --> 00:01:22.948
Either way, drinking one
is way better than

00:01:22.948 --> 00:01:26.452
eating a pizza covered
in nuts and bolts.

00:01:26.452 --> 00:01:29.088
A woman reportedly ate half
of her Domino's Pizza

00:01:29.088 --> 00:01:31.457
before finding them
in her toppings.

00:01:31.457 --> 00:01:33.659
Can you imagine digesting
all that cheese and metal?

00:01:33.659 --> 00:01:35.361
I mean, that would rock you
like a...

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:37.130
hurricane that was
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:39.465
downgraded
to a tropical depression.

00:01:39.465 --> 00:01:41.133
Sure, it doesn't feel good
to be demoted,

00:01:41.133 --> 00:01:42.968
but keep your head up, Henri.

00:01:42.968 --> 00:01:45.471
[ Laughter ]
If you work hard
and do your best,

00:01:45.471 --> 00:01:47.039
you, too, can be the

00:01:47.039 --> 00:01:48.942
Storm invited
to the White House.

00:01:48.942 --> 00:01:51.611
[ Laughter ]
The team took pictures
with the Bidens

00:01:51.611 --> 00:01:53.813
and, of course, a lot of the
players are taller than them.

00:01:53.813 --> 00:01:57.150
And, if you want something tall,
that's from Seattle, why not try

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:59.485
Starbucks' pumpkin spice latte.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:59.485 --> 00:02:03.256
It's only five bucks
for a tall.

00:02:03.256 --> 00:02:06.159
So, it'll be on the house,
if you

00:02:06.159 --> 00:02:08.127
find nuts and bolts in it.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.127 --> 00:02:09.595
If that woman sues Domino's,

00:02:09.595 --> 00:02:10.963
she could probably
make a lot of money.

00:02:10.963 --> 00:02:12.132
I bet she could even

00:02:12.132 --> 00:02:14.233
make it rain.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:14.233 --> 00:02:16.135
Henri broke the record
for rainfall

00:02:16.135 --> 00:02:19.105
in one hour in New York,
which is nuts.

00:02:19.105 --> 00:02:20.806
And bolts.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.806 --> 00:02:22.475
In conclusion,

00:02:22.475 --> 00:02:24.109
OMG,

00:02:24.109 --> 00:02:25.612
FYI,

00:02:25.612 --> 00:02:26.912
PSL!,

00:02:26.912 --> 00:02:28.280
FML.

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:30.917
[ Cheering and applause ]
This has been a "News Smash."

00:02:30.917 --> 00:02:33.119
♪♪

00:02:33.119 --> 00:02:37.289
[ Whistling ]
♪♪

00:02:37.289 --> 00:02:38.957
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:38.957 --> 00:02:40.426
Thank you very much. Wow.

00:02:40.426 --> 00:02:42.328
[ Applause ]

00:02:42.328 --> 00:02:44.897
Here's some good news --
today, the FDA granted

00:02:44.897 --> 00:02:47.599
full approval
to Pfizer's COVID vaccine.

00:02:47.599 --> 00:02:53.473
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:53.473 --> 00:02:55.141
It's about time!

00:02:55.141 --> 00:02:57.977
Their statement started with,
"Hey, sorry, I just saw this."

00:02:57.977 --> 00:03:02.915
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.915 --> 00:03:05.417
Yeah, it was approved
by the real FDA,

00:03:05.417 --> 00:03:07.086
the Food and Drug
Administration,

00:03:07.086 --> 00:03:09.422
which is not to be confused
with the fake FDA,

00:03:09.422 --> 00:03:11.223
the Facebook Doctors
Association.

00:03:11.223 --> 00:03:12.625
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah!

00:03:12.625 --> 00:03:14.093
-Yeah, this is great news,
although,

00:03:14.093 --> 00:03:16.094
if it didn't get approved,
I'm not really sure

00:03:16.094 --> 00:03:17.130
what the options were.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:18.464
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.464 --> 00:03:19.966
Pfizer store credit?

00:03:19.966 --> 00:03:21.600
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:23.102
Must be weird,
working at the FDA.

00:03:23.102 --> 00:03:25.238
One day, you're approving
a lifesaving vaccine;

00:03:25.238 --> 00:03:27.740
the next, you're approving
new S'mores-flavored Oreos.

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:30.109
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.109 --> 00:03:32.578
Get this -- Which I don't
believe is a real thing,

00:03:32.578 --> 00:03:34.580
but, if it is --
-If it isn't, it should be.

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:37.483
-Yeah, I would -- yeah.
I'd get the shot and the cookie,

00:03:37.483 --> 00:03:39.452
yeah, both.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:39.452 --> 00:03:43.422
Get this -- the new name of the
fully approved Pfizer vaccine is

00:03:43.422 --> 00:03:46.492
Co-- Comirnaty.

00:03:46.592 --> 00:03:48.961
[ Laughter ]
Comirnaty, which sounds more

00:03:48.961 --> 00:03:50.596
like a drunk person trying
to say, "Community."

00:03:50.596 --> 00:03:51.797
[ Laughter ]

00:03:51.797 --> 00:03:52.965
[ Slurring words ]
You can't arrest me.

00:03:52.965 --> 00:03:55.300
I'm a valued member
of the community.

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:58.671
[ Laughter ]
[ Hiccough ]

00:03:58.671 --> 00:04:00.106
[ Applause ]
But the vaccine isn't

00:04:00.106 --> 00:04:01.907
the only thing keeping
the FDA busy.

00:04:01.907 --> 00:04:04.577
They recently had to tell people
not to treat COVID

00:04:04.577 --> 00:04:07.747
with a drug that's given
to animals with worms.

00:04:07.747 --> 00:04:09.582
[ Laughter ]
This is real. They tweeted...

00:04:14.253 --> 00:04:17.423
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:17.423 --> 00:04:21.260
[ Rimshot ]

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:23.062
Meanwhile, the people
taking it are like --

00:04:23.062 --> 00:04:24.597
[ Southern accent ]
Laugh all you want,
but I don't have COVID

00:04:24.597 --> 00:04:26.432
and the worms are
almost gone, so.

00:04:26.432 --> 00:04:28.634
[ Laughter ]

00:04:28.634 --> 00:04:29.902
Some entertainment news --

00:04:29.902 --> 00:04:31.938
well, due to his past
offensive comments,

00:04:31.938 --> 00:04:35.107
Mike Richards has stepped down
as host of "Jeopardy!",

00:04:35.107 --> 00:04:36.976
after just one day of filming.

00:04:36.976 --> 00:04:41.447
[ Laughter ]

00:04:41.447 --> 00:04:45.651
Yeah, he was only the host
for five shows.

00:04:45.651 --> 00:04:48.287
Come on. Half the contestants
last longer than he did.

00:04:48.287 --> 00:04:49.789
[ Laughter ]

00:04:49.789 --> 00:04:51.457
That's right,
he's stepping down as host,

00:04:51.457 --> 00:04:55.294
but he'll remain as the show's
executive producer.

00:04:55.294 --> 00:04:56.962
Not a great look on his résumé.

00:04:56.962 --> 00:04:59.631
It's like having your jobs
listed as Wendy's cashier,

00:04:59.631 --> 00:05:01.601
Wendy's manager,
Wendy's cashier.

00:05:01.601 --> 00:05:02.902
[ Laughter ]

00:05:02.902 --> 00:05:05.772
And, finally, inspired
by a recent TikTok trend,

00:05:05.772 --> 00:05:08.107
a Domino's in Australia
has unveiled

00:05:08.107 --> 00:05:10.509
an unusual new menu item.
Take a look at this.

00:05:10.509 --> 00:05:12.878
-Domino's is getting inventive.

00:05:12.878 --> 00:05:15.281
Their Australian account
posted this video

00:05:15.281 --> 00:05:17.983
of them creating
a new summer-themed pizza.

00:05:17.983 --> 00:05:20.686
The crust is actually made

00:05:20.686 --> 00:05:22.221
of watermelon.

00:05:22.221 --> 00:05:24.557
It's topped with tomato sauce
and pepperoni.

00:05:24.557 --> 00:05:27.293
[ Ewwing and laughter ]

00:05:27.293 --> 00:05:28.761
Honestly, I'd rather have
the pizza topped

00:05:28.761 --> 00:05:30.096
with nuts and bolts.

00:05:30.096 --> 00:05:31.264
[ Applause ]

00:05:31.264 --> 00:05:33.432
Today,
the U.S. intelligence agencies

00:05:33.432 --> 00:05:37.437
finished their review
on the origins of COVID-19.

00:05:37.437 --> 00:05:39.271
Then, Americans said,
"Hold that thought.

00:05:39.271 --> 00:05:40.907
There's a new
'Spider-Man' trailer, y'all."

00:05:40.907 --> 00:05:43.609
[ Laughter ]

00:05:43.609 --> 00:05:46.945
That's right, after a version
of the trailer leaked online,

00:05:46.945 --> 00:05:49.315
Sony released the official
teaser trailer

00:05:49.315 --> 00:05:51.284
for "Spider-Man: No Way Home"

00:05:51.284 --> 00:05:54.253
and it already has
over 200 million views.

00:05:54.253 --> 00:05:56.255
[ Murmuring ]
Yeah, fans are going nuts.

00:05:56.255 --> 00:05:57.623
People haven't been this excited

00:05:57.623 --> 00:05:58.958
about a kid who lives
with his aunt

00:05:58.958 --> 00:06:00.560
since "The Fresh Prince
of Bel-Air."

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:02.228
[ Laughter ]

00:06:02.228 --> 00:06:05.063
In the trailer, Spider-Man
visits Doctor Strange

00:06:05.063 --> 00:06:07.734
and asks him to turn back time.

00:06:07.734 --> 00:06:10.069
Then, President Biden shows up
and asks for the same thing.

00:06:10.069 --> 00:06:12.872
[ Laughter ]

00:06:12.872 --> 00:06:15.074
Speaking of new films,
Netflix just announced

00:06:15.074 --> 00:06:17.376
the release dates of 42 movies

00:06:17.376 --> 00:06:20.612
that are hitting the platform
by the end of this year.

00:06:20.612 --> 00:06:21.747
[ Oohing ]

00:06:21.747 --> 00:06:23.249
Even the Hallmark Channel
was like,

00:06:23.249 --> 00:06:24.750
"Maybe should just
slow down a bit, you know?

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:27.419
[ Laughter ]
Like quality over quantity,"
yeah.

00:06:27.419 --> 00:06:29.088
42 new movies.

00:06:29.088 --> 00:06:30.923
When they heard that,
Disney+ said, "Crap.

00:06:30.923 --> 00:06:33.092
Get some Avengers in front
of a greenscreen, now!"

00:06:33.092 --> 00:06:34.593
[ Laughter ]

00:06:34.593 --> 00:06:37.763
Netflix also announced
all their holiday movies.

00:06:37.763 --> 00:06:39.598
-Whoo!
-Yeah, they were like,
"Okay, Starbucks,

00:06:39.598 --> 00:06:42.068
we see your pumpkin spice latte
in August

00:06:42.068 --> 00:06:43.769
and raise you
'Single All the Way.'"

00:06:43.769 --> 00:06:45.270
[ Laughter ]

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:46.772
Well, guys,
as I mentioned today,

00:06:46.772 --> 00:06:49.441
the report on the origins
of COVID was completed

00:06:49.441 --> 00:06:53.979
and an unclassified version will
soon be released to the public.

00:06:53.979 --> 00:06:55.781
And, like everything
with this pandemic,

00:06:55.781 --> 00:06:57.950
I'm sure Americans
will fully accept the truth

00:06:57.950 --> 00:07:01.554
and it'll put all conspiracy
theories to rest, finally.

00:07:01.554 --> 00:07:04.223
[ Laughter and applause ]
I knew it. I just know it.

00:07:04.223 --> 00:07:06.559
It's really going to be great.
-Yeah.

00:07:06.559 --> 00:07:09.228
Case closed.
-Yeah, the unclassified report

00:07:09.228 --> 00:07:11.063
will come out in a few days,

00:07:11.063 --> 00:07:13.566
or sooner, if Sony
accidentally leaks it early.

00:07:13.566 --> 00:07:14.733
[ Laughter ]

00:07:14.733 --> 00:07:17.069
Some more COVID news --
I saw that Pfizer

00:07:17.069 --> 00:07:21.574
is changing the name
of their vaccine to Comirnaty.

00:07:21.574 --> 00:07:25.244
[ Smattering of laughter ]
Yeah, Comirnaty.

00:07:25.244 --> 00:07:27.413
It's a combination of the terms

00:07:27.413 --> 00:07:32.919
COVID-19, mRNA,
community, and immunity.

00:07:32.919 --> 00:07:34.586
[ Laughter ]

00:07:34.586 --> 00:07:35.888
-Okay.
-Sure.

00:07:35.888 --> 00:07:37.256
[ Laughter ]

00:07:37.256 --> 00:07:39.391
Let see how that's going
for everyone.

00:07:39.391 --> 00:07:42.562
-The vaccine has been known
as the Pfizer vaccine

00:07:42.562 --> 00:07:45.431
and will now be marketed
as "Co-mihr-nah-tee."

00:07:45.431 --> 00:07:46.598
-"Co-meer-natty."

00:07:46.598 --> 00:07:48.634
-Comirnaty.
-"Comir-notty."

00:07:48.634 --> 00:07:50.636
[ Laughter ]
-"Co-meer- Co-meer-notty."

00:07:50.636 --> 00:07:52.071
-"Co- Comir-netty."

00:07:52.071 --> 00:07:53.605
-"Corma-- Corminot.

00:07:53.605 --> 00:07:55.674
Comirna-tee."

00:07:55.674 --> 00:07:56.675
-"Cuh-mare-uh-tay."

00:07:56.675 --> 00:07:58.110
Well, I guess we'll figure out

00:07:58.110 --> 00:07:59.611
how they're going
to pronounce that.

00:07:59.611 --> 00:08:02.381
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:08:02.381 --> 00:08:04.382
One anchor was like,
"Formerly known as the

00:08:04.382 --> 00:08:05.584
'Puh-fizzer' vaccine."

00:08:05.584 --> 00:08:07.353
[ Laughter ]

00:08:07.353 --> 00:08:08.688
Listen, if they really
wanted people to take it,

00:08:08.688 --> 00:08:10.088
they should've just called it
White Claw.

00:08:10.088 --> 00:08:12.023
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:12.023 --> 00:08:14.059
That's right, Pfizer announced
that they're renaming

00:08:14.059 --> 00:08:15.928
their vaccine Comirnaty,

00:08:15.928 --> 00:08:17.730
which led to another
interesting announcement.

00:08:17.730 --> 00:08:18.964
Watch this.

00:08:18.964 --> 00:08:21.400
-This year, Johnson &amp; Johnson
has been so proud

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:24.236
to offer its very own
COVID-19 vaccine.

00:08:24.236 --> 00:08:26.505
And today,
we're even prouder to announce

00:08:26.505 --> 00:08:27.907
its brand-new name...

00:08:29.141 --> 00:08:31.343
[ Laughter ]
That's right, the J&amp;J vaccine

00:08:31.343 --> 00:08:33.345
is now called
the Pfizer vaccine.

00:08:33.345 --> 00:08:34.579
Bye-bye, bad press.

00:08:34.579 --> 00:08:36.015
Hello, rebrand.

00:08:36.015 --> 00:08:38.951
[ Laughter ]

00:08:38.951 --> 00:08:40.052
[ Applause ]
-That's interesting.

00:08:40.052 --> 00:08:41.553
That's a good name.

00:08:41.553 --> 00:08:43.088
It's a great name for it.

00:08:43.088 --> 00:08:46.092
[ Applause continues ]

00:08:46.092 --> 00:08:47.760
Well, this is going viral --

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:49.929
the other day,
Rudy Giuliani was spotted

00:08:49.929 --> 00:08:52.631
in the Delta Lounge at JFK,

00:08:52.631 --> 00:08:54.733
shaving.
[ Laughter ]

00:08:54.733 --> 00:08:57.136
This is real.
Take a look at this.

00:08:59.271 --> 00:09:01.340
[ Laughter ]
He's at the table.

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:02.608
He's at the table, shaving.

00:09:05.211 --> 00:09:08.246
[ Laughter ]

00:09:08.246 --> 00:09:10.048
Then, Rudy left to do
a press conference

00:09:10.048 --> 00:09:11.884
at Four Seasons
Total Manscaping.

00:09:11.884 --> 00:09:14.386
[ Laughter ]

00:09:14.386 --> 00:09:17.055
Hey, get this --
I saw that Oscar Meyer

00:09:17.055 --> 00:09:20.091
is teaming up with Lyft
to surprise rideshare passengers

00:09:20.091 --> 00:09:21.560
with the Wienermobile.

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:23.562
[ Laughter ]

00:09:23.562 --> 00:09:25.064
Yeah, if there's one thing
everyone loves,

00:09:25.064 --> 00:09:27.533
it's a giant wiener-related
surprise, don't you think?

00:09:27.533 --> 00:09:28.734
[ Laughter ]

00:09:28.734 --> 00:09:30.536
It's a fun idea,
until you have a job interview

00:09:30.536 --> 00:09:31.804
and the Wienermobile shows up.

00:09:31.804 --> 00:09:33.105
[ Laughter ]

00:09:33.105 --> 00:09:35.173
Finally, speaking of hot dogs,
a new study suggests

00:09:35.173 --> 00:09:39.445
that eating one hot dog
takes 35 minutes off your life.

00:09:39.445 --> 00:09:41.080
Americans heard that
and were like, "Yikes.

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:43.115
In that case, give me
the double bacon cheeseburger."

00:09:43.115 --> 00:09:44.482
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:44.482 --> 00:09:46.018
Today, President Biden

00:09:46.018 --> 00:09:50.055
held a meeting with the C.E.O.s
of Amazon, Apple, and Microsoft

00:09:50.055 --> 00:09:54.260
to discuss the growing threat of
cyberattacks and data leaks.

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:55.761
They've got their
work cut out for them,

00:09:55.761 --> 00:09:56.762
because right before
the meeting,

00:09:56.762 --> 00:09:57.929
you could hear a voice say,

00:09:57.929 --> 00:09:59.297
[ Russian accent ]
"Ready when you are."

00:09:59.297 --> 00:10:01.334
[ Laughs ]

00:10:03.101 --> 00:10:05.805
Yeah, it was a good meeting,
although Biden's at that age

00:10:05.805 --> 00:10:06.939
where he puts the word "the"

00:10:06.939 --> 00:10:09.675
before anything tech-related,
like,

00:10:09.675 --> 00:10:13.946
[As President Biden] "I order
from the Amazon all the time.

00:10:13.946 --> 00:10:16.949
I just type it into the Google."

00:10:16.949 --> 00:10:18.517
[ Normal voice ] At 78,
Biden might not seem

00:10:18.517 --> 00:10:19.785
like the right guy
to handle this,

00:10:19.785 --> 00:10:21.921
but trust me,
no one is better equipped

00:10:21.921 --> 00:10:23.956
at stopping leaks.

00:10:24.957 --> 00:10:26.325
-Ah!

00:10:26.325 --> 00:10:29.628
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:10:29.628 --> 00:10:31.396
-Thank you.

00:10:31.396 --> 00:10:33.131
Here's some big news.

00:10:33.131 --> 00:10:35.634
Today, Johnson &amp; Johnson
announced that a booster shot

00:10:35.634 --> 00:10:40.339
of their vaccine provides a
robust increase in antibodies.

00:10:40.339 --> 00:10:44.176
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:10:44.176 --> 00:10:45.645
It's kind of like
Chef Boyardee saying,

00:10:45.645 --> 00:10:49.648
"Our new sauce
is robust in flavor."

00:10:49.648 --> 00:10:52.317
Well, guys,
if doctors aren't busy enough,

00:10:52.317 --> 00:10:54.553
they're now dealing with
the latest online trend.

00:10:54.553 --> 00:10:55.721
Listen to this.

00:10:55.721 --> 00:10:58.157
-There is another
dangerous Internet challenge

00:10:58.157 --> 00:10:59.925
that people should be
watching out for.

00:10:59.925 --> 00:11:03.094
-It's something called the
Milk Crate Challenge.

00:11:03.094 --> 00:11:06.131
Doctors warn it could land you
on a trip to the E.R.

00:11:06.131 --> 00:11:08.734
-Half of Americans said,
"Of course,"

00:11:08.734 --> 00:11:10.035
while the other half said,

00:11:10.035 --> 00:11:12.605
"It's my choice, and I want to
do my own research."

00:11:12.605 --> 00:11:14.773
No. Don't do that.

00:11:14.773 --> 00:11:16.942
Seriously, imagine surviving
a global pandemic,

00:11:16.942 --> 00:11:19.645
then having your family find out
it's the Milk Crate Challenge

00:11:19.645 --> 00:11:21.013
is what got you.

00:11:21.013 --> 00:11:22.782
Some business news.

00:11:22.782 --> 00:11:25.784
Today, OnlyFans
decided to drop their plan

00:11:25.784 --> 00:11:28.153
to ban
sexually explicit content.

00:11:28.153 --> 00:11:31.656
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:11:31.656 --> 00:11:34.993
[ Rimshot ]
-Wow!

00:11:34.993 --> 00:11:37.329
Whole corner of them.
-Yeah.

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:40.766
So, between this and
the new "Spider-Man" trailer,

00:11:40.766 --> 00:11:42.000
what a week for teenage boys.

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:47.473
You know what I'm saying?
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:11:47.473 --> 00:11:49.141
That's right -- OnlyFans will

00:11:49.141 --> 00:11:51.944
keep allowing
sexually explicit content.

00:11:51.944 --> 00:11:53.278
Thank goodness,
because without this,

00:11:53.278 --> 00:11:55.313
who knows where you'd be able to
find that stuff online.

00:11:55.313 --> 00:11:57.149
You know what I'm saying?

00:11:57.149 --> 00:11:59.818
Well, get this -- I saw that
you can rent a vacation cabin

00:11:59.818 --> 00:12:02.887
in Oklahoma that's completely
decked out with Nerf toys.

00:12:02.887 --> 00:12:03.889
Check this out.

00:12:03.889 --> 00:12:05.091
-Ooh!

00:12:05.091 --> 00:12:06.424
-Yeah.

00:12:06.424 --> 00:12:07.792
Yeah, it's great if
you're training your kid

00:12:07.792 --> 00:12:09.628
to be the next John Wick.

00:12:11.397 --> 00:12:14.099
It's like 30 guns.

00:12:14.099 --> 00:12:16.068
And, finally,
as part of their new fall menu,

00:12:16.068 --> 00:12:21.774
Starbucks has added a new drink,
the Apple Crisp Macchiato.

00:12:21.774 --> 00:12:24.076
In response, the
Pumpkin Spice Latte was like,

00:12:24.076 --> 00:12:25.143
"Oh, it's on.

00:12:25.143 --> 00:12:27.279
Let's go."

00:12:27.279 --> 00:12:29.114
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:12:29.114 --> 00:12:30.615
Let's get to some news, guys.

00:12:30.615 --> 00:12:34.586
This week, in a company memo,
the CEO of Delta Air Lines

00:12:34.586 --> 00:12:38.457
refused to use the term
Delta variant

00:12:38.457 --> 00:12:42.928
and only referred to the virus
by its scientific name.

00:12:42.928 --> 00:12:44.830
I guess that explains why pilots
have been saying,

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:48.300
"Welcome aboard. Thank you
for flying B.1.617.2 Airlines."

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:49.701
[ Laughter ]

00:12:49.701 --> 00:12:52.471
Apparently, he's afraid that
if he says Delta too many times,

00:12:52.471 --> 00:12:54.306
the virus will show up
like Candyman.

00:12:54.306 --> 00:12:55.841
[ Laughter ]

00:12:55.841 --> 00:12:57.476
Yeah, he's doing anything he can

00:12:57.476 --> 00:12:59.611
to distance Delta
from the variant.

00:12:59.611 --> 00:13:01.080
Today, he said, "From now on,

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:03.082
our airline's pronounced
Del-tay."

00:13:03.082 --> 00:13:04.750
[ Laughter ]

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:07.252
That's right. Delta is in
a pretty weird situation,

00:13:07.252 --> 00:13:09.254
but this is nice --
Another company just released

00:13:09.254 --> 00:13:11.290
a message of support.
Watch this.

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:14.293
-We sympathize with
Delta CEO Ed Bastian.

00:13:14.293 --> 00:13:15.627
Hang in there.

00:13:15.627 --> 00:13:18.764
The only piece of advice
we could offer is to be patient.

00:13:18.764 --> 00:13:21.767
And before long, your company
name won't be associated

00:13:21.767 --> 00:13:23.701
with something so horrific.

00:13:23.701 --> 00:13:26.938
-A message from Ebola Farms
Baked Goods and Treats.

00:13:26.938 --> 00:13:28.774
Put a little Ebola in your day.

00:13:28.774 --> 00:13:30.276
-Yeah.

00:13:30.276 --> 00:13:31.910
Ebola Farms.

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:33.479
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:13:33.479 --> 00:13:35.781
What?

00:13:35.781 --> 00:13:37.115
I love that bread.

00:13:37.115 --> 00:13:40.452
-I love Ebola Farms.
-Yeah, that's the best.

00:13:40.452 --> 00:13:42.554
And they make bread.
-Yeah. I didn't know that.

00:13:42.554 --> 00:13:43.622
I just thought it was a farm.

00:13:43.622 --> 00:13:45.791
-Yeah, you'd think
it'd be a bakery.

00:13:45.791 --> 00:13:47.626
You think it'd be Ebola Bakery
or something.

00:13:47.626 --> 00:13:49.761
-Got a bunch of pretzels,
anything you want.

00:13:49.761 --> 00:13:50.795
-Oh, really?
-Yeah.

00:13:50.795 --> 00:13:52.831
Oh, my God.
-Any type of carb?

00:13:52.831 --> 00:13:54.966
-Any kind of carb,
any kind of baked bread.

00:13:54.966 --> 00:13:56.135
They got strudel.

00:13:56.135 --> 00:13:58.436
Oh, delicious. Delicious.
-Oh, strudel.

00:13:58.436 --> 00:14:00.906
Guys, get this,
a new report found

00:14:00.906 --> 00:14:03.209
