scanning my face,"

00:14:11.082 --> 00:14:12.751
and then went back
to pulling down their masks

00:14:12.751 --> 00:14:14.086
to unlock their phones.

00:14:14.086 --> 00:14:15.420
[ Laughter ]

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:17.422
Yep, most U.S.
government agencies

00:14:17.422 --> 00:14:20.558
